ting-devices#Customizing-pointers","line":132},{"title":"An illustration of a custom pointer hovering over a resize handle on the edge of a shaded rectangle. Above the pointer is a small annotation that displays the image’s width and height values against a dark background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/291aebad59eee8712e94047fcca4e7cf/useful-pointer-annotation%402x.png","line":144,"embedded":true},{"title":"macOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#macOS","line":150},{"title":"Pointers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Pointers","line":173},{"title":"`arrow`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/arrow","line":179},{"title":"A pointer that resembles a diagonal arrow pointing up and to the left.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5be2c381c17d5d868866b3a5de1013f8/pointers-arrow%402x.png","line":179,"embedded":true},{"title":"`closedHand`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/closedHand","line":180},{"title":"A closed, gloved hand.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6680cdb870edf5364f84a483fd2bead9/pointers-closed-hand%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"`contextualMenu`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/contextualMenu","line":181},{"title":"A pointer arrow with a small menu-like square to the right of the arrow.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0cb033cee3b55bd4be661b28b928fdc1/pointers-contextual-menu%402x.png","line":181,"embedded":true},{"title":"`crosshair`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/crosshair","line":182},{"title":"A plus symbol.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d55eabe14365af873000aa389e5fad6c/pointers-crosshair%402x.png","line":182,"embedded":true},{"title":"`disappearingItem`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/disappearingItem","line":183},{"title":"A small pointer arrowhead with a circle underneath; the circle contains an Ex.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/528819d511869de26beb1fd5008ac773/pointers-disappearing-item%402x.png","line":183,"embedded":true},{"title":"`dragCopy`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/dragCopy","line":184},{"title":"A small pointer arrowhead with a circle underneath; the circle contains a plus symbol.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ccc7052f9bc6fb302d913633c648adcd/pointers-drag-copy%402x.png","line":184,"embedded":true},{"title":"`dragLink`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/dragLink","line":185},{"title":"A curved arrow, pointing up and to the right.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/47dfbfd5f1bf3141dbf875f47446d1fd/pointers-drag-link%402x.png","line":185,"embedded":true},{"title":"`iBeam`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/iBeam","line":186},{"title":"Opposing veritcal braces, used to form an insertion marker.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/060f443dee8d260a1a1191d7831e36b7/pointers-horizontal-beam%402x.png","line":186,"embedded":true},{"title":"`openHand`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/openHand","line":187},{"title":"An open, gloved hand.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a5daee642ccc8fb3ac550d176b2d1932/pointers-open-hand%402x.png","line":187,"embedded":true},{"title":"`operationNotAllowed`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/operationNotAllowed","line":188},{"title":"A small pointer arrowhead with a do not enter symbol underneath.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2daaf47bef26569f92f30a9016095dde/pointers-operation-not-allowed%402x